        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 675.0926000000001,
        "r": 485.5500000000002,
        "b": 667.4847008403361
      },
      "content": "Unplug dishwasher or disconnect power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0854",
      "reading_order": 955,
      "section": "Removing the Control Panel",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 662.0926000000001,
        "r": 560.2600000000002,
        "b": 644.4847008403361
      },
      "content": "Perform the procedures on page 4-2, 'Remove Outer Door Panel' prior to performing the following steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0855",
      "reading_order": 956,
      "section": "Removing the Control Panel",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 639.0926000000001,
        "r": 524.5000000000001,
        "b": 631.4847008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove the eight (8) screws indicated in Figure 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0856",
      "reading_order": 957,
      "section": "Removing the Control Panel",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 280.0926,
        "r": 543.9300000000004,
        "b": 262.48470084033613
      },
      "content": "Disconnect the User Interface harness and remove the handle cover. See Figure 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0857",
      "reading_order": 958,
      "section": "Removing the Control Panel",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 257.09259999999995,
        "r": 534.0200000000001,
        "b": 239.48470084033613
      },
      "content": "Remove the two (2) screws (indicated in Figure 2) to remove the User Interface PCBA."
    },
